{"id": "EUVD-2026-103009", "enisaUuid": "b2fa130b-cb99-3876-9bf1-646abfa19459", "description": "Arkon through 0.9.2 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in list_skill_versions that allows authenticated employees to read other departments' skill version metadata by bypassing the can_access_skill check. Attackers holding the default skill:read permission can request GET /api/skills/{slug}/versions for another department's skill to obtain version numbers, hashes, storage paths and changelogs.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:40:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T18:18:24", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/arkon-wiki-graph-cross-department-idor", "https://github.com/nduckmink/arkon/blob/v0.9.2/app/routers/skills.py#L427-L434", "https://github.com/nduckmink/arkon/blob/v0.9.2/app/routers/skills.py#L408-L425", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/arkon-through-0.9.2-missing-authorization-via-skills-versions-api"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111717", "GHSA-f92x-p3q7-cx4j"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d3ddf14a-76c8-39d7-9354-374cbce96d5e", "product": {"name": "arkon", "vendor": {"name": "nduckmink"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.9.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "97a19782-4805-3143-a164-6506f1d9de3b", "vendor": {"name": "nduckmink"}}], "isExploited": false}